CotangentSchubert -- A package for cotangent Schubert calculus
**************************************************************

Description
===========

CotangentSchubert is a package for calculations in cotangent Schubert calculus.
Specifically, it allows to compute motivic Chern and Segre classes (as well as
their limits in ordinary Schubert calculus, namely Schubert classes), and to
independently compute the expansion of their products using puzzles. Puzzles
and their "fugacities" are defined and computed using the results of [1,2,3].

References: 
 [1] A. Knutson and P. Zinn-Justin, Schubert puzzles and integrability
 [2] A. Knutson and P. Zinn-Justin, Schubert puzzles and integrability
 [3] A. Knutson and P. Zinn-Justin, Schubert puzzles and integrability
I: invariant trilinear forms, arXiv:1706.10019 (see http://arxiv.org
II: multiplying motivic Segre classes, arXiv:2102.00563 (see http://
III: separated descents, arXiv:2306.13855 (see http://arxiv.org/abs/
/abs/1706.10019 ). 
