*****************************************

  * Usage: 
        doublePuzzle (a,b,c,d)
  * Inputs:
      * a, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, 
      * b, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, 
      * c, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, 
      * d, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Equivariant (missing documentation) => ..., default value true, 
      * Generic (missing documentation) => ..., default value true, 
      * Ktheory (missing documentation) => ..., default value false, 
      * Ktheory' (missing documentation) => ..., default value false, 
      * Separation (missing documentation) => ..., default value null, 
