restrict -- Restriction to fixed points
***************************************

Description
===========

Given a (K-theory or cohomology) class in a ring defined by *note
setupCotangent: setupCotangent, with the options Presentation => Borel and
Equivariance => true, this function computes its restriction to fixed points
(effectively, giving the class as would be produced by the option Presentation
=> EquivLoc).

