tautoClass -- Compute the class of a tautological bundle
********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        tautoClass (i,j)
        tautoClass (i,j,A)
  * Inputs:
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * j, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * A, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 

Description
===========

This function computes the i-th Chern class of the j-th tautological bundle of
the flag variety whose K-theory (or cohomology) ring is given by A. If A is not
specified, then the ring that was defined last is used.

